For #46585

This adds a new `WebviewView` proposed api to VS Code that lets webview be used inside views. Webview views can be contributed using a contribution point such as :

```json
    "views": {
      "explorer": [
        {
          "type": "webview",
          "id": "cats.cat",
          "name": "Cats",
          "visibility": "visible"
        }
      ]
    },
```
